## Conventions

- Focused diffs; no unrelated refactors.
- Extend parsers via patterns in **`commentHeatmap.js`** / **`socialInteractionGraph.js`**.
- **One animation library:** GSAP only (already in `package.json`).
- Quips on hero/dark slides use `SLIDE_INSIGHT_PUNCH_ON_DARK` (bordered box).

## API (backend, optional)

- `GET /health` → `{ "ok": true }`
- `POST /upload` — legacy Non-Followers (not in UI)
